	"description": [
		"This course introduces the craft of creative writing through contemporary readings and writing exercises in poetry and prose. Students learn to read and to write texts with attention to how a literary work is constructed. Emphasis on the elements of craft and strategies for revision prepare students to pursue the creative writing major or the English major with teaching licensure. Offered every semester."
